### Tasks

Tasks are defined once in `pyproject.toml` under `[tool.poe.tasks]`.

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `uv run poe check` | Everything below, in order |
| `uv run poe lint` | Ruff lint |
| `uv run poe format` | Ruff format |
| `uv run poe typecheck` | {{ 'mypy' if type_checking == 'mypy' else 'pyright' if type_checking == 'pyright' else 'mypy, then pyright' }} |
| `uv run poe test` | pytest with coverage |
{%- if use_docs %}
| `uv run poe docs` | Serve docs locally |
{%- endif %}

Run `check` before pushing — CI runs the same tasks.

